WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.089 --> 00:00:15.730
and Edward ran down the streets of London.

2
00:00:16.731 --> 00:00:20.232
When they got to the Globe Theater, it was full of people.

3
00:00:21.193 --> 00:00:23.274
Edward paid and they went inside.

4
00:00:23.294 --> 00:00:27.596
"Wow!" said Vinnie, looking around.

5
00:00:29.052 --> 00:00:32.395
The stage rose above the ground about one meter.

6
00:00:33.656 --> 00:00:36.599
The seats formed a half circle around the stage.

7
00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:40.543
They were on three levels, three stories high.

8
00:00:41.544 --> 00:00:43.125
The theater had no roof.

9
00:00:44.146 --> 00:00:47.809
Many people were standing on the ground in front of the stage.

10
00:00:47.829 --> 00:00:49.991
"What's the show?"

11
00:00:50.552 --> 00:00:51.212
asked Vinnie.

12
00:00:51.232 --> 00:00:54.896
"Romeo and Juliet," said Edward.

13
00:00:55.804 --> 00:00:59.366
Mandy was sitting with Lady Katherine on the second level.

14
00:01:00.287 --> 00:01:04.269
The richer people sat there because the seats were more expensive.

15
00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:08.612
The poorer people didn't have seats.

16
00:01:09.852 --> 00:01:12.234
They just stood in front of the stage.

17
00:01:13.434 --> 00:01:16.596
Mandy looked down and saw a familiar face.

18
00:01:16.616 --> 00:01:19.758
"Vinnie!" she shouted.

19
00:01:20.839 --> 00:01:21.679
Vinnie heard her.

20
00:01:22.179 --> 00:01:22.920
He looked up.

21
00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:27.621
"Mandy!" he yelled, and waved.

22
00:01:27.641 --> 00:01:30.903
"Vinnie, I'll be right down!"

23
00:01:31.423 --> 00:01:32.223
cried Mandy.

24
00:01:33.444 --> 00:01:35.925
"Stop!" snapped Lady Katherine.

25
00:01:37.065 --> 00:01:39.846
"My servants do not shout like street people!"

26
00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:43.608
Mandy apologized.

27
00:01:43.628 --> 00:01:46.289
"That's my brother," she said.

28
00:01:46.309 --> 00:01:48.470
"I have to go to him."

29
00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:54.932
"You may not leave without my permission," said Lady Katherine.

30
00:01:54.952 --> 00:01:57.474
"But I have to," said Mandy.

31
00:01:58.455 --> 00:02:00.836
She got up and walked to the stairs.

32
00:02:01.877 --> 00:02:05.019
Vinnie ran to the steps, but a guard stopped him.

33
00:02:05.039 --> 00:02:09.042
"You can't go up there," the guard grunted.

34
00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:12.064
"That level is for lords and ladies!"

35
00:02:13.304 --> 00:02:16.326
"But my sister Vinnie said, pointing.

36
00:02:16.346 --> 00:02:18.007
"Go back!"

37
00:02:18.608 --> 00:02:19.528
shouted the guard.

38
00:02:19.929 --> 00:02:21.009
"You're probably a thief!"

39
00:02:21.029 --> 00:02:27.297
"Come, Vinnie," said Edward, "I know of a secret stairway backstage."

40
00:02:28.177 --> 00:02:30.038
He took Vinnie behind the stage.

41
00:02:31.199 --> 00:02:33.360
Actors were getting into their costumes.

42
00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.741
Vinnie noticed something very strange.

43
00:02:36.761 --> 00:02:39.462
"Is Juliet a man?"

44
00:02:40.183 --> 00:02:41.183
he asked Edward.

45
00:02:42.244 --> 00:02:43.844
Edward burst out laughing.

46
00:02:43.864 --> 00:02:48.607
"All the actors are men!

47
00:02:49.827 --> 00:02:51.668
Women are not allowed on stage!"

48
00:02:52.784 --> 00:02:55.306
Suddenly, the guard was right behind them.

49
00:02:55.326 --> 00:02:57.368
"You are a thief!"

50
00:02:58.008 --> 00:03:01.071
he yelled, shaking his fist angrily at Vinnie.

51
00:03:01.091 --> 00:03:03.853
"Trying to steal from the actors!"

52
00:03:05.134 --> 00:03:07.976
He grabbed Vinnie and threw him on the floor.

53
00:03:09.778 --> 00:03:12.380
Just then, Mandy ran backstage.

54
00:03:13.521 --> 00:03:16.783
She looked around and saw Vinnie lying on the floor.

55
00:03:17.884 --> 00:03:20.486
Vinnie jumped up and grabbed Mandy's hand.

56
00:03:20.947 --> 00:03:21.848
"Run, Mandy!"

57
00:03:24.256 --> 00:03:25.617
"I'll keep the guard busy!"

58
00:03:26.338 --> 00:03:27.839
Edward shouted behind them.

59
00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:33.984
Vinnie and Mandy ran through the crowd, out of the theater, and into the street.

60
00:03:35.125 --> 00:03:36.827
Suddenly, Mandy screamed.

61
00:03:38.188 --> 00:03:40.970
Two large carriages almost ran over them.

62
00:03:41.891 --> 00:03:44.153
The drivers shouted angrily.

63
00:03:44.913 --> 00:03:47.415
A tall man got down from one carriage.

64
00:03:47.435 --> 00:03:49.817
"Are you children crazy?"

65
00:03:50.458 --> 00:03:50.998
he said.

66
00:03:51.018 --> 00:03:52.680
"Watch where you're going!"

67
00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:59.583
"They were running from someone," said a woman's voice from inside the carriage.

68
00:04:01.764 --> 00:04:03.986
The man held out his hand to the woman.

69
00:04:05.146 --> 00:04:07.908
She took his hand and stepped out of the carriage.

70
00:04:08.908 --> 00:04:11.109
She was dressed in a deep-purple gown.

71
00:04:11.129 --> 00:04:14.751
"Bow before your queen," the man said.

72
00:04:16.052 --> 00:04:19.554
Everyone on the street stopped and bowed to the woman.

73
00:04:19.574 --> 00:04:26.475
"Is that Vinnie gulped, .Queen Elizabeth?"

74
00:04:26.495 --> 00:04:30.158
"Search them," she ordered.

75
00:04:31.379 --> 00:04:34.122
Two guards began searching Vinnie and Mandy.

76
00:04:35.523 --> 00:04:37.485
One guard found the glowing photo.

77
00:04:38.045 --> 00:04:40.107
"Your Majesty!"

78
00:04:40.587 --> 00:04:41.288
he gasped.

79
00:04:42.569 --> 00:04:45.912
With shaking hands, he handed the picture to the queen.

80
00:04:47.073 --> 00:04:47.954
She looked at it.

81
00:04:48.474 --> 00:04:50.096
Then she looked at the children.

82
00:04:51.064 --> 00:04:55.369
"Magic is not allowed in my kingdom," she said calmly.

83
00:04:55.389 --> 00:04:57.751
"Take them to the tower."
